2FY25_PAT\"","\"H1FY27\"","\"103.3707\"","\"218.3751\"","\"283.9941\"","\"208.2226\"","\"26.9140\"","\"18.3615\"","\"19.5677\"","\"R26; H1FY25=FY25−H2FY25\"","\"ND; not released as of cutoff; no postcutoff data\"","\"unbilled\"","\"associated_accrued_costs\"","\"reported_total_income\"","\"adjusted_total_income\"","\"consolidated_PAT_adjusted\"","\"adjusted_equity\"","\"adjusted_assets\"","\"adjusted_liabilities\"","\"statement_EPS\"","\"AR_EPS\"","\"interpretation\"","\"107.7677\"","\"90.2401\"","\"492.7304\"","\"384.9627\"","\"32.1592\"","\"174.5125\"","\"606.1291\"","\"431.6166\"","\"39.46\"","\"42.58\"","\"R26pp19–20; A26p95\"","\"Qualification-adjusted disclosure is alternative diagnostic, not established collectability or clean normalized earnings.\"","\"supplier_advances\"","\"other_advances\"","\"retentions\"","\"government_balances\"","\"GST_receivable\"","\"staff_advances\"","\"prepaid\"","\"deposits\"","\"restricted_or_unverified_FD\"","\"customer_advances\"","\"salary_payable\"","\"director_payable\"","\"other_operating_payable\"","\"statutory_payable\"","\"tax_provision\"","\"NCI\"","\"financial_investments\"","\"longterm_otheradv\"","\"deferred_tax\"","\"bankguarantee\"","\"gratuity\"","\"AR_over_1year\"","\"AR_over_6months\"","\"FY25_AR_over_1year\"","\"current_debt_maturities\"","\"revolver_and_bill_debt\"","\"intercorporate_debt\"","\"director_debt\"","\"107.7678\"","\"68.8794\"","\"110.9565\"","\"3.4157\"","\"43.1400\"","\"14.8999\"","\".0331\"","\".1457\"","\"4.7850\"","\"11.8231\"","\"137.1620\"","\"9.2803\"","\"2.0321\"","\".2965\"","\"3.9098\"","\"26.2774\"","\".0023\"","\".0219\"","\".1441\"","\".0505\"","\"8.8925\"","\"1.8080\"","\"24.3173\"","\"26.8581\"","\"2.0835\"","\"7.6487\"","\"64.6343\"","\"10\"","\"5.5970\"","\"preWC_cash\"","\"trade_receivables\"","\"WIP\"","\"other_current_liabilities\"","\"other_noncurrent_assets\"","\"tax_provision_change\"","\"gratuity_paid\"","\"tax_paid\"","\"CFO\"","\"FD_change\"","\"interest_received\"","\"equity_receipts\"","\"new_borrowing\"","\"repayment\"","\"interest_paid\"","\"net_change\"","\"note\"","\"74.2013\"","\"-44.2261\"","\"-7.0495\"","\"-229.5558\"","\"114.7399\"","\"72.2126\"","\".7280\"","\"9.9179\"","\"-.1654\"","\"-16.3788\"","\"-94.8240\"","\"-5.1165\"","\".4609\"","\"1.1575\"","\"131.3750\"","\"-.5910\"","\"-6.0119\"","\".8741\"","\"Rounding0.0001crore retained. CFO includes working capital and tax; do not subtract again. Interest is financing.\"","\"authorized_shares\"","\"tax\"","\"nci\"","\"director_interestfree\"","\"current_maturities\"","\"revolver_principal\"","\"start\"","\"scenarios\"","\"notes\"","10633000","58500000","\".25\"","\"74.6343\"","\"ar\"","\"wip\"","\"supplieradv\"","\"retention\"","\"otheradv\"","\"customeradv\"","\"accrual\"","\"deposit\"","\"fixed\"","\"11.6089\"","\"bear\"","\"base\"","\"bull\"","\"sales\"","\"margins\"","\"preentry_revenue\"","\"preentry_margin\"","\"preentry_capex\"","\"dso\"","\"wip_ratio\"","\"advance_ratio\"","\"retention_ratio\"","\"new_unbilled_days\"","\"payable_ratio\"","\"customer_advance_ratio\"","\"accrual_ratio\"","\"deposit_ratio\"","\"old_unbilled_collection\"","\"other_advance_collection\"","\"wc_ramp_days\"","\"fixed_ratio\"","\"maintenance\"","\"cash_cycles\"","\"cash_floor\"","\"existing_rate\"","\"bank_rate\"","\"bank_limit\"","\"issue_price\"","\"issue_fee\"","\"equity_limit\"","\"later_term_amortization\"","\"discount_rate\"","\"terminal_growth\"","\"terminal_tax_reserve\"","\"statutory_settlement\"","\"guarantee_call\"","\"semiconductor_outflow\"","\"unavailable_cash\"","\"380\"","\"390\"","\"410\"","\"440\"","\"470\"","\".06\"","\".065\"","\".07\"","\".075\"","\".08\"","\"450\"","\"20\"","\"130\"","\".20\"","\".18\"","\".007\"","\"55\"","\".12\"","\".024\"","\".01\"","\"365\"","\".23\"","\".02\"","\".025\"","\"3\"","\".11\"","\".13\"","\"173.55\"","\".03\"","\"100\"","\"8\"","\".15\"","\"550\"","\"630\"","\"710\"","\"790\"","\"860\"","\".115\"","\"520\"","\"12\"","\"95\"","\".155\"","\".14\"","\"25\"","\".22\"","\".50\"","\"650\"","\"780\"","\"920\"","\"1060\"","\"1200\"","\".145\"","\"580\"","\"75\"","\".10\"","\".24\"","\"1\"","\".75\"","\"Forecasts are analyst assumptions, not management commitments. March 2026 balances are qualification-affected; the pre-entry bridge is unverified. H1 FY27 was not published by cutoff. No modeled cash surplus cures G2.\"","\"Opening cash availability is tested on 31 March 2026. Pre-entry runs 1 April to 19 October 2026, 202 days. Five post-entry years use 19 October anniversaries. Monthly costs are paid before receipts in four cycles; one, two and eight cycles are also tested. Period-end-only survival is insufficient. New finance accrues interest from the next period, reflecting assumed month-end draws.\"","\"The ₹20 crore optional incremental bank limit is hypothetical, not the difference between rated facilities and outstanding debt. Existing ₹74.6343 crore demand/bill/intercorporate debt is settled at the analytical one-year boundary unless conditional rollover is assumed. Senior principal and interest are modeled. Later term amortization of ₹8 crore a year is analytical, not contractually verified.\"","\"Equity is capped at ₹100 crore gross, with a 25% issue discount and 3% fees. Shares round up to whole shares required, constrained by authorized capital of 58.5 million shares and the gross cash cap. Proceeds and dilution are linked. No pre-entry equity is allowed, preserving verified 10.633 million issued shares. Rescue is hypothetical, not an issuer plan or committed funds.\"","\"Other advances of ₹110.9565 crore lack verified counterparties and terms. Base collects 25% over two years, bull 75%, bear zero; remaining assets receive no separate terminal value. Old unbilled revenue of ₹107.7678 crore runs off over three years at scenario recovery rates; billing does not equal collection. New unbilled work is funded separately.\"","\"Separate FD of ₹11.8231 crore and government/GST assets of ₹58.0399 crore are excluded from available opening cash and not added to terminal value. Existing statutory dues of ₹3.9098 crore are paid in the first operating period. Tax assets/provisions are excluded from upside; a terminal tax-reserve sensitivity tests obligation risk. Gratuity is within the current payroll/accrual approximation.\"","\"Operating hire and rent remain in EBIT and cash costs; no unsupported AS 17 finance-lease liability is invented. NCI of ₹0.0023 crore is deducted. No dividends are modeled or double-counted.\"","\"Terminal FCFF deducts maintenance and incremental fixed and operating working capital. A further year of cash testing requires optional-bank maturity repayment and no new finance before ordinary returns are allowed. Existing revolver rollover remains conditional. Every failed ledger is retained even where later negative-cash diagnostics continue.\"","\"factors\"","\"caps\"","\"evidence\"","\"basis\"","\"contrary\"","\"Medium\"","\"E03\"","\"E09\"","\"E10\"","\"E11\"","\"E16\"","\"Recurring statutory delays, historical internal-audit absence and contradictory proceeds-use reporting materially weaken stewardship. Remuneration escalated despite negative CFO.\"","\"No fraud or default was reported. Independent directors, audit-trail/IFC reports and promoter collateral provide contrary support. No substantiated diversion, so no automatic GOV ≤ 3 or G1 failure.\"","\"E12\"","\"E13\"","\"E14\"","\"Maintenance track record and customer qualification help win repeat work, but competitive tenders and customer/project concentration prevent verified pricing power.\"","\"The multiyear ONGC relationship and execution experience may support entry barriers; excess cash returns and a defined market share are unproven.\"","\"Low\"","\"E02\"","\"E20\"","\"Reported five- and three-year CAGRs reach the 9 starting anchor, but ₹107.77 crore latest unbilled revenue and changing gross/WIP mix prevent a reliable underlying-growth score. NS is not an arbitrary penalty.\"","\"Even qualification-adjusted revenue implies substantial multiyear expansion. No assumption is made that all growth is fabricated.\"","\"E15\"","\"Recurring maintenance and a long ONGC relationship create accessible demand. Scaling remains constrained by cash, production and concentrated Epitome execution.\"","\"Semiconductor TAM is excluded; established customer relationships and new field work offer genuine opportunities.\"","\"E04\"","\"E05\"","\"E07\"","\"E18\"","\"Large FY26 ONGC and land investments, and ₹110.96 crore other advances, prevent attribution of incremental returns. Aggregate proxies cannot validate cohort economics.\"","\"Reported EBIT/NOPAT growth is positive and some assets are commissioned; this is not proof that capital was destroyed.\"","\"E06\"","\"E08\"","\"Four consecutive negative-CFO years, cumulative collection deficits and older receivables despite large customer/supplier funding show persistent poor realization.\"","\"Some absorption funds genuine growth. The conclusion survives all retained CFO vintages and is not merely one year of capex.\"","\"Cash of ₹6.58 crore versus debt of ₹142.22 crore, large demand/bill exposure and guarantees imply funding fragility. The model requires rapid collections or optional credit.\"","\"No default was reported and the June 2026 rating improved to BBB+/A2. A rating is not verified drawable headroom. G3 is a hold, not proven actual insolvency.\"","\"Revenue, equipment and workover milestones are real, but Epitome timing and unbilled-certification/mainboard promises remain unresolved. Higher throughput is not equivalent to collection.\"","\"Ten CWP workovers were reported complete. H2 weakness was attributed to supply-chain issues, but independent milestone cash acceptance is missing.\"","\"Reported PAT is largely operating, yet a ₹13.1163 crore qualification impact and inconsistent EPS prevent reliable normalized per-share growth.\"","\"Other income is only ₹0.5136 crore, dilution is bounded and current issued capital is verified.\"","\"There is no defensible unconditional base IRR because of pre-entry cash failures and unresolved financial reliability. Conditional scenarios are illustrations only.\"","\"The optional-finance bull case works under strong collection and margin assumptions, but is not a committee-ready base case.\"","\"A credible permanent-loss path arises from uncertified work, uncollected advances and senior claims. Returns are suppressed after any cash breach.\"","\"Reported net assets and customer support could recover value. NS recovery price is not an assertion of zero recovery.\"","\"Low reported P/E cannot establish implied expectations until earnings and funding are reliable. Reverse trials test conditional required economics.\"","\"The quotation implies less than the strong bull case, but unverified asset quality dominates the multiple.\"","\"E01\"","\"E17\"","\"The 2.43-session exit at 5% participation starts at score 7. An explicit one-point downgrade for unverified spread/depth and SME lot/circuit execution gives 6.\"","\"Every one of 60 sessions traded, and a ₹46,280 lot fits the reference position. A lower price is not evidence of absent liquidity.\"","\"5 because CASH = 2 reflects persistent poor realization.\"","\"date\"","\"source_url\"","\"zip_sha256\"","\"rows\"","\"present\"","\"2026-07-24\"","\"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/content/cm/BhavCopy_NSE_CM_0_0_0_20260724_F_0000.csv.zip\"","\"885df092735bcffd03abaf20d27ec0823d570dc0cbe53e0853d82e85a9beae64\"","\"TradDt\"","\"BizDt\"","\"Sgmt\"","\"Src\"","\"FinInstrmTp\"","\"FinInstrmId\"","\"ISIN\"","\"TckrSymb\"","\"SctySrs\"","\"XpryDt\"","\"FininstrmActlXpryDt\"","\"StrkPric\"","\"OptnTp\"","\"FinInstrmNm\"","\"OpnPric\"","\"HghPric\"","\"LwPric\"","\"ClsPric\"","\"LastPric\"","\"PrvsClsgPric\"","\"UndrlygPric\"","\"SttlmPric\"","\"OpnIntrst\"","\"ChngInOpnIntrst\"","\"TtlTradgVol\"","\"TtlTrfVal\"","\"TtlNbOfTxsExctd\"","\"SsnId\"","\"NewBrdLotQty\"","\"Rmks\"","\"Rsvd1\"","